# purpose: M1 and M2 rules in combination across five accounts, ~150 lines. Not a test of any one
#          rule - a test of keeping the state straight when everything happens at once.
# exercises: deposits/withdrawals interleaved across accounts; freeze windows during which a
#            burst of commands is refused; closures mid-file; malformed lines that must not
#            advance <seq>; precedence pairs (frozen+insufficient, closed+non-positive).

# --- setup
OPEN ann USD
OPEN ben USD
OPEN cat EUR
OPEN dan GBP
OPEN eve EUR
DEPOSIT ann 500
DEPOSIT ben 20
DEPOSIT cat 75.25
DEPOSIT dan 1000
DEPOSIT eve 0.5

# --- a normal day
WITHDRAW ann 120
DEPOSIT ben 30
WITHDRAW cat 25.25
WITHDRAW dan 999.99
DEPOSIT eve 4.5
WITHDRAW ben 60
WITHDRAW ann 0
DEPOSIT dan 0.01
WITHDRAW eve 5
BALANCE eve
WITHDRAW eve 0.01
DEPOSIT cat -3
DEPOSIT cat 3
WITHDRAW ben 50
WITHDRAW ben 0.01
BALANCE ann

# --- ben is frozen: a burst of refusals, then things he is still allowed to do
FREEZE ben
DEPOSIT ben 10
WITHDRAW ben 10
DEPOSIT ben -10
WITHDRAW ben 1000
BALANCE ben
FREEZE ben
DEPOSIT ann 1
WITHDRAW dan 1
DEPOSIT ben 10
UNFREEZE ben
DEPOSIT ben 10
BALANCE ben

# --- malformed lines sprinkled in; <seq> must not move
DEPOSIT ann 2
deposit ann 2
DEPOSIT ann
DEPOSIT ann 2.001
DEPOSIT ann 2
OPEN fay usd
OPEN fay
OPEN fay USD
DEPOSIT fay 1

# --- cat closes: needs zero first, and stays closed
CLOSE cat
BALANCE cat
WITHDRAW cat 53
CLOSE cat
DEPOSIT cat 1
WITHDRAW cat 1
FREEZE cat
UNFREEZE cat
CLOSE cat
BALANCE cat
OPEN cat EUR
OPEN cat USD

# --- dan: frozen and broke at the same time - frozen wins; then unfrozen and broke
WITHDRAW dan 0.02
FREEZE dan
WITHDRAW dan 5
WITHDRAW dan -5
UNFREEZE dan
WITHDRAW dan 5
WITHDRAW dan -5
DEPOSIT dan 5
WITHDRAW dan 5
BALANCE dan

# --- eve: tiny amounts, many times
DEPOSIT eve 0.01
DEPOSIT eve 0.02
DEPOSIT eve 0.03
DEPOSIT eve 0.04
DEPOSIT eve 0.05
DEPOSIT eve 0.06
DEPOSIT eve 0.07
DEPOSIT eve 0.08
DEPOSIT eve 0.09
BALANCE eve
WITHDRAW eve 0.45
WITHDRAW eve 0.01
BALANCE eve

# --- unknown accounts, every verb
DEPOSIT gus 1
WITHDRAW gus 1
FREEZE gus
UNFREEZE gus
CLOSE gus
BALANCE gus

# --- fay finally exists, is frozen with money in it, and cannot be closed
DEPOSIT fay 9
FREEZE fay
CLOSE fay
UNFREEZE fay
WITHDRAW fay 9
FREEZE fay
CLOSE fay
BALANCE fay

# --- ann drains to zero the long way
WITHDRAW ann 300
WITHDRAW ann 80
WITHDRAW ann 4
WITHDRAW ann 0.5
BALANCE ann
WITHDRAW ann 0.5
CLOSE ann
BALANCE ann

# --- final state
BALANCE ben
BALANCE dan
BALANCE eve
